_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/f22955628d77e118887578e2f03ab992.webm?t=1785449235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/f22955628d77e118887578e2f03ab992.mp4?t=1785449235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comic-Style Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shadows lunge, the game shifts into a tabletop inspired, stylized narrative encounter. Choose how to react to every monster attack, but be careful, your success is dictated by each investigator's unique build and even the best laid plans can go awry with just a few bad choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.poster.avif?t=1785449235\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.webm?t=1785449235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/7790cf119ed6cbccb74e11341838bc35.mp4?t=1785449235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Can Be Prepared, But You Will Never Be Ready...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you gather from successful investigations to buy permanent upgrades and crafting blueprints that will better help your chances of surviving within The Mansion... a bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598880/extras/636617f9e41788d1166c96765f528a44.poster.avif?t=1785449235\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i